§§ `Is a proposed custodial sentence within the most the text states?`

-- arguments: the offence, the kind of sentence, whether it is for life, the months
-- section 16: imprisonment not exceeding 120 months (ten years), on indictment
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 16: threats to kill` `a sentence of imprisonment` FALSE 120 EQUALS `within the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 16: threats to kill` `a sentence of imprisonment` FALSE 121 EQUALS `above the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 16: threats to kill` `a sentence of imprisonment` TRUE 0 EQUALS `above the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 16: threats to kill` `a sentence of penal servitude` FALSE 12 EQUALS `the text states no sentence of that kind for this offence`
-- section 4: imprisonment for life, so any term is within
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 4: soliciting or proposing a murder` `a sentence of imprisonment` TRUE 0 EQUALS `within the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 4: soliciting or proposing a murder` `a sentence of imprisonment` FALSE 600 EQUALS `within the maximum the text states`
-- section 23: penal servitude not exceeding ten years
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 23: administering poison so as to endanger life or inflict grievous bodily harm` `a sentence of penal servitude` FALSE 120 EQUALS `within the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 23: administering poison so as to endanger life or inflict grievous bodily harm` `a sentence of penal servitude` FALSE 121 EQUALS `above the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 23: administering poison so as to endanger life or inflict grievous bodily harm` `a sentence of penal servitude` TRUE 0 EQUALS `above the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 23: administering poison so as to endanger life or inflict grievous bodily harm` `a sentence of imprisonment` FALSE 12 EQUALS `the text states no sentence of that kind for this offence`
-- section 20: penal servitude with no term stated, so no maximum can be applied
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 20: wounding or inflicting grievous bodily harm` `a sentence of penal servitude` FALSE 12 EQUALS `the text states no maximum for that kind of sentence`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 20: wounding or inflicting grievous bodily harm` `a sentence of penal servitude` TRUE 0 EQUALS `the text states no maximum for that kind of sentence`
-- section 28: penal servitude for life, or imprisonment with no term stated
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 28: causing bodily injury by an explosion` `a sentence of penal servitude` TRUE 0 EQUALS `within the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 28: causing bodily injury by an explosion` `a sentence of imprisonment` FALSE 60 EQUALS `the text states no maximum for that kind of sentence`
-- section 30: penal servitude not exceeding fourteen years (168 months), or imprisonment with no term stated
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 30: placing an explosive near a building, ship or vessel, with intent` `a sentence of penal servitude` FALSE 168 EQUALS `within the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 30: placing an explosive near a building, ship or vessel, with intent` `a sentence of penal servitude` FALSE 169 EQUALS `above the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 30: placing an explosive near a building, ship or vessel, with intent` `a sentence of imprisonment` FALSE 24 EQUALS `the text states no maximum for that kind of sentence`
-- section 57: penal servitude not exceeding seven years (84 months)
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 57: bigamy` `a sentence of penal servitude` FALSE 84 EQUALS `within the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 57: bigamy` `a sentence of penal servitude` FALSE 85 EQUALS `above the maximum the text states`
-- section 34: imprisonment not exceeding two years (24 months)
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 34: endangering railway passengers` `a sentence of imprisonment` FALSE 24 EQUALS `within the maximum the text states`
#ASSERT `a proposed custodial sentence measured against the text` `s 34: endangering railway passengers` `a sentence of imprisonment` FALSE 25 EQUALS `above the maximum the text states`
